WEBVTT

00:10:55.880 --> 00:11:00.073
that by the end of 2007, this bubble

00:11:00.073 --> 00:11:02.042
would change regime.

00:11:02.042 --> 00:11:05.127
There might be a crash. Certainly not sustainable.

00:11:05.127 --> 00:11:10.369
Now, how do you believe the very smart,

00:11:10.369 --> 00:11:15.799
very motivated, very informed macro hedge fund managers

00:11:15.799 --> 00:11:17.755
reacted to this prediction?

00:11:17.755 --> 00:11:19.711
You know, they had made billions

00:11:19.711 --> 00:11:22.546
just surfing this bubble until now.

00:11:22.546 --> 00:11:24.130
They told me, "Didier,

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:27.167
yeah, the market might be overvalued,

00:11:27.167 --> 00:11:29.063
but you forget something.

00:11:29.063 --> 00:11:31.415
There is the Beijing Olympic Games coming